\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png/25px-Portrait_Blurg.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blurg\" title=\"Blurg\">Blurg</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/38px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/50px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Derryth Bonecloak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\">Derryth Bonecloak</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Myconid_Colony\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Myconid Colony\">Myconid Colony</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a></li>\n<li>Dropped by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mud_Mephit\" title=\"Mud Mephit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Mud_Mephit.png/25px-Portrait_Mud_Mephit.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Mud_Mephit.png/38px-Portrait_Mud_Mephit.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Mud_Mephit.png/50px-Portrait_Mud_Mephit.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mud Mephit\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Mud_Mephit.png/25px-Portrait_Mud_Mephit.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Portrait_Mud_Mephit.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mud_Mephit\" title=\"Mud Mephit\">Mud Mephits</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The name of the ingredient is not exactly the same as the extract</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mud_mephit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mud mephit\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mud_mephit\">Mud mephit</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714213541\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU